    "summary": "Panic on a mailbox display name containing CR or LF allows denial of service",
    "details": "A `Mailbox` whose display name contains a CR or LF panics when it is formatted\nor put in a header such as `From` or `To`. Someone who can choose a display\nname, for example the name of a user a message is sent to, can crash the\nthread or task building the message.\n\nApplications that take display names only from trusted input are not exposed.",
    "severity": [],
